msgstr "은(는) 눈앞이 새하얘진다!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "I'll make a map of Heaven next!"
msgstr "다음엔 천국 지도를 그릴게!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "DAMN YOU ALL!"
msgstr "다 저주받아라!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "you suck"
msgstr "너 구려"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "it's OK, i'll be back in 250 years!"
msgstr "괜찮아, 250년 뒤에 돌아올게!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:224
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "LOOKS LIKE WE FOUND OUT WHO THE REAL JOKER IS."
msgstr "진짜 광대가 누군지 드러났군."

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "Welp, there goes our budget!"
msgstr "이런, 예산 다 날렸네!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "Trittst im Morgenrot daher..."
msgstr "새벽빛 속에 나타나시어..."

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "ROCK AND STOOOnnnneee..."
msgstr "바위와 도오오올..."

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:233
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "The mission...is over..."
msgstr "임무는... 끝났다..."

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:234
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "arrwooo..."
msgstr "아우우..."

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "BETTER THIS THAN SODDING PIRATES!"
msgstr "빌어먹을 해적보단 낫지!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "AY CRUMBO!!!"
msgstr "아이 크럼보!!!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:272
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "CAAAAAAAAAAAAAAW!"
msgstr "까아아아아아악!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "The skeleton was inside of me the whole time!"
msgstr "해골은 처음부터 내 안에 있었어!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "I WILL BE UNDEFEATED!"
msgstr "난 패배하지 않는다!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:326
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid " DIED!!!!"
msgstr "이(가) 죽었다!!!!"

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "COMBAT : "
msgstr "전투 : "

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid " TACTIC : "
msgstr " 전술 : "

#: deathforth/mission-events-human.df:573
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events-human.df"
msgid "CRIT!"
msgstr "치명타!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "OH NO!"
msgstr "안 돼!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid " are"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid " is"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid " not here, and will be left behind."
msgstr "은(는) 여기 없어서 남겨지게 된다."

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Stay and find them."
msgstr "남아서 찾는다."

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Just GO!"
msgstr "그냥 가자!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:105 deathforth/mission-events.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "LEAVING"
msgstr "떠나기"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "EXITING ZOMBO TOWN"
msgstr "좀보 마을 떠나기"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Do you want to go back to the title screen?"
msgstr "타이틀 화면으로 돌아갈까?"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Do you want to walk back to the road?"
msgstr "걸어서 도로로 돌아갈까?"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "You will abandon your car "
msgstr "차를 두고 "

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "if you "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "waltz off"
msgstr "걸어가면"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid " without it!"
msgstr " 차는 버리고 가는 거다!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:119 deathforth/mission-events.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "No, stay here."
msgstr "아니, 여기 남는다."

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Yes, let's hit the road."
msgstr "그래, 다시 출발하자."

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:135 deathforth/mission-events.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "NO ESCAPE"
msgstr "탈출 불가"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid ""
"You can't leave from this location. You will have to find another way out."
msgstr "여기로는 나갈 수 없다. 다른 출구를 찾아야 한다."

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid ""
"It's too dangerous outside right now. You can't leave from this location "
"yet."
msgstr "지금은 밖이 너무 위험하다. 아직 여기로 나갈 수 없다."

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:151
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Do you want to leave this location?"
msgstr "여기를 떠날까?"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:157
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Yes, let's go."
msgstr "그래, 가자."

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:167 deathforth/mission-events.df:201
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "OH, NO"
msgstr "이런!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:168
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Your mission leader has died! Pick a new leader:"
msgstr "임무 리더가 죽었다! 새 리더를 골라라:"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "FAILED!"
msgstr "실패!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Your scavenging team was wiped out! Better get out of here!"
msgstr "물자 수집팀이 전멸했다! 어서 여기서 나가야 한다!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Everyone else is dead! "
msgstr "나머지는 모두 죽었다! "

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid " is all alone..."
msgstr "은(는) 혼자 남는다..."

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:268 deathforth/mission-events.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "QUIT?"
msgstr "종료?"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:271 deathforth/mission-events.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "EXIT the game?"
msgstr "게임을 종료할까?"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "ABORT the game and quit to the title screen?"
msgstr "게임을 중단하고 타이틀 화면으로 돌아갈까?"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "You can resume the game later with CONTINUE GAME!"
msgstr "나중에 게임 계속하기로 이어 할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "EXIT ZOMBO TOWN"
msgstr "좀보 마을 떠나기"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid ""
"Return to the title screen?\r\n"
"\t\tAny upgrades you have purchased are already saved."
msgstr ""
"타이틀 화면으로 돌아갈까?\r\n"
"\t\t구매한 강화는 이미 저장되어 있다."

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "WARNING: Quitting directly from a mission will delete the save!"
msgstr "경고: 임무 도중 종료하면 저장 파일이 지워진다!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "QUIT AND DELETE SAVE"
msgstr "종료하고 저장 삭제"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid " is just a "
msgstr "은(는) 그저 "

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "dumb animal"
msgstr "멍청한 동물"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid " and can't lead a solo mission. Sad!"
msgstr "이라 혼자 임무를 이끌 수 없다. 슬프네!"

#: deathforth/mission-events.df:344
msgctxt "deathforth/mission-events.df"
msgid "Sup."
msgstr "안녕."

#: deathforth/mission.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
"The Anime Girl was going to explode, but got prevented from doing so at the "
"last possible moment."
msgstr "애니 소녀가 폭발하려 했지만, 마지막 순간에 가까스로 막았다."

#: deathforth/mission.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "Anime Overdose"
msgstr "애니 과다복용"

#: deathforth/mission.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
" suddenly explodes while on the road. Everything is heavily damaged by "
"flying shards of anime."
msgstr "은(는) 여행 중 갑자기 폭발한다. 날아든 애니 파편이 모든 것을 심하게 파괴한다."

#: deathforth/mission.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "ANIME GIRL GETS OBLITERATED!"
msgstr "애니 소녀가 소멸했다!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " uses their quick body reflexes to dive for cover!"
msgstr "은(는) 재빠른 반사 신경으로 몸을 날려 숨는다!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " follows their lead!"
msgstr "은(는) 뒤따라 몸을 숨긴다!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "End of the Battle"
msgstr "전투의 끝"

#: deathforth/mission.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "The knight"
msgstr "기사"

#: deathforth/mission.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
" thanks you for the experience, but says she should probably go on her own "
"from here. She starts slowly clanking away!"
msgstr "은(는) 값진 경험에 감사하지만 이제 혼자 가야 할 것 같다고 한다. 느릿느릿 철컹대며 떠난다!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "After seeing it in action, "
msgstr "실전 모습을 본 뒤, "

#: deathforth/mission.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
" has to buy the sword.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 이 검을 꼭 사고 싶어진다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/mission.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "You will not regret this purchase! Good luck out there!"
msgstr "후회 안 할 거야! 행운을 빌어!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "Cold Steel Live Demo"
msgstr "콜드 스틸 실전 시연"

#: deathforth/mission.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " is raring to go!"
msgstr "은(는) 출발할 준비가 됐다!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t\tAre you ready to see the power of a Cold Steel weapon?\r\n"
"\t\t\tYou'll see what this greatsword can do once you let me out of this car!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t\t콜드 스틸 무기의 위력을 볼 준비 됐어?\r\n"
"\t\t\t차에서 내보내 주면 이 대검의 힘을 보여 주지!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "The demonstration is over!"
msgstr "시연이 끝났다!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tWell, are you ready for the power of a Cold Steel sword?\r\n"
"\t\tI'll give you a discount because we fought together as warriors! 33% off!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t자, 콜드 스틸 검의 위력을 받아들일 준비 됐어?\r\n"
"\t\t함께 싸운 전우니까 할인해 줄게! 33% 할인!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "I'm still not good enough for it "
msgstr "아직 그 검엔 내가 부족해 "

#: deathforth/mission.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "Buy it! - 30 food"
msgstr "산다! - 식량 30"

#: deathforth/mission.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " 33% Discount!"
msgstr " 33% 할인!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:140 deathforth/mission.df:141
#: deathforth/mission.df:142 deathforth/mission.df:148
#: deathforth/mission.df:149 deathforth/mission.df:150
#: deathforth/mission.df:156 deathforth/mission.df:157
#: deathforth/mission.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "CAN'T FIX SELF!"
msgstr "스스로는 못 고쳐!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:167
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "YOU CAN'T STOP WHAT'S COMING"
msgstr "다가오는 것을 막을 수 없다"

#: deathforth/mission.df:168
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " notices that "
msgstr "은(는) 보게 된다. "

#: deathforth/mission.df:168
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " is melting in real time. This is mildly concerning!"
msgstr "이(가) 실시간으로 녹고 있다. 조금 걱정된다!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
"THIS IS JUST LIKE WHEN SUN-CHAN ANNIHILATED EARTH-CHAN IN MY APOCALYPSE-PUNK"
" ANIMES!"
msgstr "내 종말 펑크 애니에서 태양짱이 지구짱을 없애 버렸을 때랑 똑같아!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
"UH YEAH BUT THAT WOULD ALSO KILL ALL OF US. SUN-CHAN SHOULD HAVE THOUGHT "
"TWICE ABOUT THAT."
msgstr "어 그래, 근데 그러면 우리도 다 죽잖아. 태양짱도 좀 더 생각했어야지."

#: deathforth/mission.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " is forced to consider the philosophical ramifications of this fact! "
msgstr "은(는) 이 사실의 철학적 의미를 생각할 수밖에 없다! "

#: deathforth/mission.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " ANIME COUNTDOWN TIMER EXTENDED!"
msgstr " 애니 폭발 제한 시간 연장!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:174 deathforth/mission.df:185
#: deathforth/mission.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " has progressed to the next stage of their transformation!"
msgstr "은(는) 변신의 다음 단계로 넘어간다!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:174 deathforth/mission.df:185
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "BEWARE...THE ANIME!"
msgstr "조심해라... 애니를!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "OH JUST YOU WAIT AND SEE"
msgstr "어디 두고 보자고"

#: deathforth/mission.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " has finally thought about "
msgstr "은(는) 드디어 생각한다. "

#: deathforth/mission.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "'s condition!"
msgstr "의 상태를!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:181
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
"HEY I DON'T FEEL SO GOOD. I WISH MORPHINE-KUN WAS HERE. SHE WOULD KNOW WHAT "
"TO SAY."
msgstr "야 나 몸이 좀 안 좋아. 모르핀군이 있으면 좋을 텐데. 무슨 말을 할지 알았을 거야."

#: deathforth/mission.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "BE STRONG FOR MORPHINE-KUN! YOU CAN DO IT! I BELIEVE IN YOU!"
msgstr "모르핀군을 위해 힘내! 할 수 있어! 널 믿어!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " is emboldened to carry on despite their condition! "
msgstr "은(는) 상태가 좋지 않아도 계속 버틸 용기를 얻는다! "

#: deathforth/mission.df:183 deathforth/mission.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "ANIME COUNTDOWN TIMER EXTENDED!"
msgstr "애니 폭발 제한 시간 연장!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "BY THE WAY, DON'T BLOW UP OR ANYTHING"
msgstr "근데 폭발 같은 건 하지 마"

#: deathforth/mission.df:191
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " has become deeply frustrated with "
msgstr "은(는) 아주 질려 버렸다. "

#: deathforth/mission.df:191
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "'s anime ranting!"
msgstr "의 애니 떠벌림에!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
"...AND THAT'S WHEN SENPAI-CHAN-KUN WENT WITH FEMALE-SAN AND SET OFF INTO THE"
" SUNSET!"
msgstr "...그래서 선배짱군이 여자씨랑 같이 석양을 향해 떠난 거야!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "COOL IT! COOL IT! PLEASE, PLEASE JUST COOL IT AND SHUT UP!"
msgstr "진정해! 진정해! 제발, 제발 진정하고 입 좀 다물어!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid ""
" is hurt by these undeserved words, and stops thinking about anime for a "
"while. "
msgstr "은(는) 억울한 말에 상처받아 잠시 애니 생각을 멈춘다. "

#: deathforth/mission.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "BEWARE...THE ANIME EXPLOSION!"
msgstr "조심해라... 애니 폭발을!"

#: deathforth/mission.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "MISSION SUMMARY"
msgstr "임무 결과"

#: deathforth/mission.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "Found:"
msgstr "발견:"

#: deathforth/mission.df:275
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid " zombies destroyed."
msgstr " 마리의 좀비 처치."

#: deathforth/mission.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "LEFT BEHIND: "
msgstr "남겨진 동료: "

#: deathforth/mission.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/mission.df"
msgid "END of DEMO"
msgstr "체험판 끝"

#: deathforth/news/news.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/news/news.df"
msgid "Spiritual Sequel"
msgstr "정신적 후속작"

#: deathforth/news/news.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/news/news.df"
msgid "With Online Co-op!"
msgstr "온라인 협동 지원!"

#: deathforth/news/news.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/news/news.df"
msgid "Trailer + Wishlist Now! [Steam]"
msgstr "예고편 + 찜하기! [Steam]"

#: deathforth/news/news.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/news/news.df"
msgid "TWITTER AND FACEBOOK"
msgstr "트위터와 페이스북"

#: deathforth/news/news.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/news/news.df"
msgid ""
"Read updates from Rocketcat Games on Twitter or Facebook for Death Road news and upcoming games!\r\n"
"\tRead Madgarden's Twitter for real Canadian Wisdom!"
msgstr ""
"로켓캣 게임즈의 트위터나 페이스북에서 데스 로드 소식과 신작 정보를 보자!\r\n"
"\t매드가든의 트위터에는 진짜 캐나다의 지혜가 있다!"
